\label{lemma-fibre-products-equalizers-exist}
Let $\mathcal{C}$ be a category.
The following are equivalent:
\begin{enumerate}
\item Connected finite limits exist in $\mathcal{C}$.
\item Equalizers and fibre products exist in $\mathcal{C}$.
\end{enumerate}

